{
  "app_id": 4224490,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Add new PCs, serve more customers, and see the cafe fill up as you progress. Compare components, preview their impact, and assemble the machine your cafe needs. Generate research points, decode data banks, and unlock new hardware and systems. Buy the licences, install the discs, and play ten retro games yourself. Clean up every hard drive, dig up lost files, and boost what each desk earns. Stock the coffee machine and keep your customers playing longer. Knock through to the room next door and make space for more desks. Open cafes around the world and lay cables between continents. Idle management on a Windows 98 desktop. Run the whole cafe from windows, a taskbar and a humming CRT. Build every PC part by part. Better hardware, faster internet, happier customers, more cash. 10 playable retro games. Stock the hits of '98 for your customers, then play them yourself. From one beige box to a worldwide franchise. Research new tech, knock down walls, open cafes across the globe."
  },
